#mucom88 1.7
#title MSX All Chips
#composer
#comment Template: MSX-MUSIC, PSG and SCC together (an MSX with an SCC cartridge)

; ==================================================================
;  A full MSX: MSX-MUSIC + PSG + SCC
;  MSXフル構成: MSX-MUSIC + PSG + SCC
; ==================================================================
; [EN] An MSX with MSX-MUSIC and an SCC cartridge can play all of these
;      at once. Here: SCC lead and harmony, MSX-MUSIC chords, bass and
;      drums, and the PSG for hi-hats.
; [JA] MSX-MUSICとSCCカートリッジのあるMSXなら、これらを同時に
;      鳴らせます。ここではSCCのリードとハーモニー、MSX-MUSICの和音・
;      ベース・ドラム、PSGのハイハット。
;
; [EN] Press Play (Ctrl+Enter) to listen. Change one thing, play again,
;      and keep what you like. Save makes a .muc on your computer.
; [JA] 再生(Ctrl+Enter)で聴いてみましょう。1か所変えてはまた再生し、
;      気に入ったら残します。「保存」でパソコンに.mucを保存できます。
; ==================================================================

; @1 organ: ALG 7, four carriers at 1x/2x/4x/1x
;    オルガン: ALG 7、4つのキャリア(1倍/2倍/4倍/1倍)
  @1
   0,7
   31,0,0,7,0,0,0,1,0
   31,0,0,7,0,0,0,2,0
   31,0,0,7,0,0,0,4,0
   31,0,0,7,0,0,0,1,3

; @2 bass: ALG 0, four operators in series
;    ベース: ALG 0、4つのオペレータを直列に
  @2
   5,0
   31,14,0,8,2,30,0,0,0
   31,14,0,8,2,40,0,1,3
   31,12,0,8,2,36,0,1,7
   31,8,4,8,2,0,0,1,0

  @W0:{ 96,96,96,96,96,96,96,96,-96,-96,-96,-96,-96,-96,-96,-96,-96,-96,-96,-96,-96,-96,-96,-96,-96,-96,-96,-96,-96,-96,-96,-96 }
  @W1:{ -127,-111,-95,-79,-63,-47,-31,-15,1,17,33,49,65,81,97,113,127,111,95,79,63,47,31,15,-1,-17,-33,-49,-65,-81,-97,-113 }

; [EN] Chords: | F | G | Em | Am | F | G | C | C |
; [JA] コード: | F | G | Em | Am | F | G | C | C |

; ---- SCC: lead and harmony / SCC: リードとハーモニー ----
SCCA T144 @0 E255,0,0,0,0,255 v7 o5 l8
SCCA L a4 >c4< a4 f4 | g4. a b4 >d4< | e4 g4 b4 g4 | a2. r4
SCCA   a4 >c4< a4 f4 | g4 a4 b4 >d4 | e2 d4 e4 | c2 r2<
SCCB @1 E255,0,0,0,0,255 v5 o5 l8
SCCB L f4 a4 f4 c4 | d4. f g4 b4 | c4 e4 g4 e4 | e2. r4
SCCB   f4 a4 f4 c4 | d4 f4 g4 b4 | >c2 <b4 >c4 | <g2 r2

; ---- MSX-MUSIC: chords, bass, drums / MSX-MUSIC: 和音・ベース・ドラム ----
MSXA @1 v12 o4 l8
MSXA L [r a]4 [r b]4 [r g]4 [r a]4 [r a]4 [r b]4 [r g]4 [r g]4
MSXB @1 v12 o4 l8
MSXB L [r f]4 [r g]4 [r e]4 [r e]4 [r f]4 [r g]4 [r e]4 [r e]4
MSXH @2 v15 o2 l8
MSXH L f4. f >f4< f4 | g4. g >g4< g4 | e4. e >e4< e4 | a4. a >a4< a4
MSXH   f4. f >f4< f4 | g4. g >g4< g4 | c4. c >c4< c4 | c4. c >c4< c4
#*1{ @1c4 @2c4 @1c8 @1c8 @2c4 }
MSXG v63,31,30,26,24,28,0
MSXG L [*1]8

; ---- PSG: hi-hat on 16ths / PSG: 16分のハイハット ----
MSXD @0 P2 w1 E150,0,90,0,0,255 v12 l16
MSXD L [c c c c]32
